          "author": "Kritika Gupta",
          "description": "Join Nomi in her cozy adventures that spark critical thinking. From soggy shoes to forgotten umbrellas, Nomi explores questions, fairness, and feelings in relatable moments. Each story invites children to observe, wonder, and reflect - building early skills like problem-solving, perspective-taking, and cause and effect. With gentle humor and real-life themes, these playful stories offer more than fun - they open the door to conversations and thinking that lasts.",
